00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:29.700
Man, I don't even know if I'm on the right track for getting a KEYCARD.

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.780
I do not think that I am...

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.400
*Sigh* Seems like he left me alone for NOW...

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:39.940
But I've gone through just about EVERY drawer that's accessible to me,

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.980
because I must be doing this, like, some wrong way...

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:46.060
There- I must not be doing this quite right...

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.960
