00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.300
Hi, 'friend'! How are you?!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.880
Woahhh boy! Oh boy, oh boy, oh boy!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:40.940
Welp, in the closet.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:43.580
You never saw me!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.240
I got a keycard!

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:51.720
