00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.040
That is good PROGRESS!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.020
But not exactly what I wanted to do.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.760
So I'm going to end this episode here...

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.500
Because I got more to figure out soon...

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.700
But I got a few pieces of the story,

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.060
and I got a few spoops.

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:37.620
That was actually terrifying.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:41.420
Being able to see the thing standing outside the door,

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.060
that's a nice touch.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:46.880
But, Five Nights at Freddy's fan game, this still is.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:49.160
So, THANK YOU everybody so much for watching,

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.280
and as always...

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:51.400
